From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:02:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Log the relay traffic by kind every 5 seconds, silence
 included

The audio receive summary only prints when a packet arrives, so a call whose
relay went quiet after the answer logged nothing. A watcher now logs how many
RTP, RTCP, STUN and other packets the relay delivered in each 5 second window
and in total, so rtp=0 with rtcp or stun still arriving tells the relay is up
and the peer sends no audio. Diagnostics only.
---
 engine_media.go       |  3 ++
 relay_traffic.go      | 69 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 relay_traffic_test.go | 23 +++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 relay_traffic.go
 create mode 100644 relay_traffic_test.go

